@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
title Ticket PR Loop - Fixes, Rechecks and Merge Conditions

state "Ticket validated\nFeature branch; selected checks passed" as ready
state "Applicable redaction + publication readiness\nIdentity / scope / actual push target\nConventional Commit -> push branch" as publish
state "Create/update existing PR\nVerify PR head/base match Ticket Branch/Base\nStatus: in_review; persist canonical PR link" as pr
state "Select review scope\nFirst full PR; bounded fixes may be incremental\nBase/history/boundary changes or uncertainty -> full" as scope
state "Execute/reuse codex review via runner\nFull logs + base/head identity + execution status\nSee review-execution.svg for exact recovery behavior" as review
state "Main agent assesses complete conclusion\nVerify previous findings + latest test evidence" as assess
state "Batch confirmed blocking findings\nFix -> affected tests -> applicable redaction\nKeep same Ticket branch and PR" as fix
state "Blocked / incomplete\nRecord cause + logs + resume stage; Issue stays open\nNever treat timeout, exit 0 or missing output as pass" as blocked #FFF4CC
state "Merge gate\nRecorded review pass + required checks passed\nPR head still equals reviewed head" as gate
state "Merge PR; verify MERGED and exact refs\nThen cleanup / sync / close Ticket\nReturn to outer Ticket loop" as merged #DCFCE7
state "Re-plan\nUpdate same Ticket / Slice contracts\nReturn to Slice loop before publishing" as replan

[*] --> ready
ready --> publish
publish --> pr : commit + push succeed
publish --> blocked : failed validation/redaction/readiness/push
pr --> blocked : API failure / metadata mismatch
pr --> scope : PR published; start automatically
scope --> review
review --> assess : complete conclusion for current head
review --> blocked : interrupted / tool or environment failure
blocked --> publish : publication cause resolved; recheck readiness
blocked --> pr : PR/metadata cause resolved; query before create
blocked --> review : review cause resolved; inspect saved run first
assess --> fix : confirmed blockers
fix --> fix : affected tests fail; diagnose and correct\nno blind retry
fix --> publish : affected tests pass; publish batch once
fix --> replan : design/scope assumption changes
replan --> ready : Slice loop and Ticket acceptance pass again
assess --> blocked : incomplete or unverifiable conclusion
assess --> gate : no remaining blockers
gate --> scope : head/base changed; choose valid coverage again
gate --> fix : required check exposes in-scope defect
gate --> blocked : external check/merge failure
blocked --> gate : external merge/check cause resolved\nreverify reviewed head and checks
gate --> merged : all merge conditions pass
merged --> [*]

note right of blocked
Arrows resume only the recorded failed stage;
they are not interchangeable shortcuts.
Environment/dependency blockers set Status: blocked.
Restore in_review when the existing PR is ready for review.
No Issue is closed merely because code was pushed.
end note
@enduml
